  "prefLabel": "Plc 1105.01 Licensee Obligations for Notifications, Updates, Promotional Materials, and Posting",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1105.01 Licensee Obligations for Notifications, Updates, Promotional Materials, and Posting. Each licensee shall comply with:\n\n(a) Plc 307.02 relative to required notifications, updates of contact information, and providing information on how complaints can be filed;\n\n(b) RSA 328-H:8, IV, relative to advertising and promotional materials; and\n\n(c) RSA 328-H:8, V, relative to posting and carrying the license.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Plc 1100) #13391, eff 5-27-22; ss by #14444, eff 1-26-26, EXPIRES: 1-26-36 (formerly Plc 1104.04)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1100.html"
